## Interface: 16001
## Title: Dossier
## Notes: Dossier, formerly AIExport. Type /dossier and press Create Export to copy a text report of your character into an AI chat. It keeps a Biography timeline, tracks kills, times play sessions with kills, gathering, gold, and XP per hour, keeps a shopping list with have and need counts, and takes screenshots at big moments. Every feature can be switched off on the Options tab or in the game's Settings > AddOns page. Optional Companions add data from Syndicator, KillDex, AllTheThings, Nova Instance Tracker, Profession Master, Auctionator, Memento, and Talents Forever when they are loaded. /dossier help shows the guide and an example AI skill.
## Category: Data Export
## Author: Dossier
## Version: 2.2.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Dossier\Media\MinimapIcon
